# Alpaca market-data credentials. Paper-account keys are enough: this project reads bars and
# places no orders. Names are Alpaca's own, so any other tool in the ecosystem reads them too.
APCA_API_KEY_ID=
APCA_API_SECRET_KEY=
# sip is the default and what every measurement is taken on: the historical consolidated tape is
# free on paper keys, back to 2016. Only real-time SIP is paid. iex is ~2-3% of the volume, its
# daily history starts in 2018 and it has gaps — it is not a cheaper option, it is a different
# sample. See CLAUDE.md.
ALPACA_FEED=sip
